OL,3,AWarm start to week to make way for
OL,4,Awetter and windier conditions
OL,5,
OL,6,FChangeable autumnal conditions are set
OL,7,Fto continue through this coming week,
OL,8,Fwith spells of wetter and windier
OL,9,Fweather developing at times.
OL,11,FMonday will bring a short-lived burst
OL,12,Fof warmth and sunshine before
OL,13,Ftemperatures drop to levels more
OL,14,Ftypical for September later in the
OL,15,Fweek.
OL,17,FA strengthening jet stream will bring
OL,18,Fdeeper, low-pressure systems as the
OL,19,Fweek goes on, with the potential for
OL,20,Fminor disruption towards next weekend.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
