OL,3,AWarm start to week to make way for
OL,4,Awetter and windier conditions
OL,5,
OL,6,FHigher pressure looks set to build
OL,7,Fagain for the end of the month, but
OL,8,Fprospects of a late-September heatwave
OL,9,Fremain uncertain.
